  AA_JOE_DESERT_PORT_BATCH_1 - support bodies/body parts for the Alpha Animals
  desert port (RSW_GreatDevourer, RSW_MatureFleshbeast).

  Source mod: Alpha Animals (`sarg.alphaanimals`, workshop 1541721856),
  1.6/Defs/Bodies/Bodies_WormWithArmor.xml,
  1.6/Defs/Bodies/Bodies_TentacledQuadrupedEyeless.xml and
  1.6/Defs/Bodies/BodyParts_Animal.xml. Alpha Animals stays an active mod
  dependency for this batch (only Joe's Cephaloids is being retired), so this
  is a straight structural copy under the RSW_ prefix, not a textures-in
  absorption - nothing here is donor-C#-dependent, body/body-part defs are
  pure data.

  defName-only rename, nothing else changed: AA_WormWithArmor -> RSW_WormWithArmor,
  AA_TentacledQuadrupedEyeless -> RSW_TentacledQuadrupedEyeless,
  AA_FirstWormSegment/AA_SecondWormSegment/AA_ThirdWormSegment/AA_FourthWormSegment
  -> RSW_ equivalents, AA_EcholocationOrgan -> RSW_EcholocationOrgan (shared by
  both bodies below, same as the donor), AA_JellyfishTentacle -> RSW_JellyfishTentacle.
  Every other referenced part (SnakeBody, SnakeHead, Skull, Brain, Heart, Lung,
  Stomach, Liver, Kidney, Nose, Jaw, Body, Spine, Neck, Head, Ear, AnimalJaw, Leg,
  Paw) is VANILLA, untouched.
-->
